:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCE a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A dog lives 10 to 15 years. It needs daily exercise, company, training and veterinary care for its whole life. Before you get a dog, check that your home, your working hours and your budget fit the dog you want." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDNZ a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "House training starts on the first day: take the puppy outside after every meal, after every nap and after play, and praise it when it relieves itself outside. Between 8 and 16 weeks, let the puppy get to know many people, sounds, surfaces and traffic in a calm way." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDPE a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A dog training course with a certified trainer is recommended in the first year. Dogs of breeds classified as dangerous must pass an obedience test." .

:su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMMK a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "The maximum time a dog may be left alone in a flat depends on the dog's education (training) and its specific breed. Owners are responsible for knowing the limit that applies to their dog." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5F9 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A kitten is a cat younger than 6 months. Kittens should not leave their mother before 12 weeks of age. Let a new kitten explore one room first, then the rest of the flat. Kittens learn to use the litter box quickly if it is easy to reach." .

:su_01M82H6T2SJCWQ88GWH3NA9WX7 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Every pet (dog or cat) must be registered with the house management within 14 days of moving in or acquiring the pet. A pet owner must make sure that their pet does not disturb other residents." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP3 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Start leash training when the puppy is 8 to 10 weeks old. Reward the dog when the leash is loose, and stop walking when the dog pulls. Never jerk the leash." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FF a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "An adult cat can stay alone for up to 24 hours if it has enough food, fresh water and a clean litter box. For longer absences, arrange for someone to visit the cat at least once a day." .

:cn_01M82GS0NSGHH6X6DCYVS251BV a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "One of five commands every dog should learn: sit, down, stay, come and leave it." ;
    skos:prefLabel "basic command" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDPD ;
    dai:level dai:level-2 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:cn_01M82H7HBZP5REB8E6N9M29JTH a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "Administers the buildings and enforces these rules." ;
    skos:prefLabel "house management" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82H6T2SJCWQ88GWH3NA9WX1,
        :su_01M82H6T2SJCWQ88GWH3NA9WX7,
        :su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMMM,
        :su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMMR,
        :su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMMW,
        :su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMN0,
        :su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMN2 ;
    dai:level dai:level-1 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:cn_01M82HBAX7NMYFG8GE4P9Y56F3 a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "waste" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMMR ;
    dai:level dai:level-2 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMMP a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Cats may move freely in the inner yard. Cats may not be kept in the stairwells or the cellar. Litter boxes must be kept inside the flat." .

:su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMN0 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Noisy work such as drilling is allowed on weekdays from 08:00 to 12:00 and from 14:00 to 18:00, and on Saturdays from 09:00 to 12:00. Announce a move to the house management at least 7 days in advance, and protect the lift with the covers provided." .

:cn_01M82GPB8ZK0N7S1VR303H5EPB a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "lead" ;
    skos:prefLabel "leash" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP1,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP3,
        :su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3W,
        :su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMMH ;
    dai:level dai:level-1 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCS a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A puppy receives its first vaccinations at 8 weeks of age. The rabies vaccination is mandatory and must be renewed every year. Take your dog to the veterinarian for a check-up at least once a year." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDPD a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Every dog should learn five basic commands: *sit*, *down*, *stay*, *come* and *leave it*. Train in short sessions of 5 to 10 minutes, several times a day, and always end with a success." .

:su_01M82H6T2T27Y7HH29TGSXAMN2 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Report damage, noise complaints and rule violations to the house management in writing. Repeated violations after a written warning may lead to termination of the tenancy." .

:su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3R a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Before you leave, walk the dog, leave water and a safe chew toy, and keep your departure low-key. If your dog barks or howls while you are away, train it to be alone step by step, starting with a few minutes." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FH a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Cats are attached to their territory. On moving day, keep the cat in a closed room with its litter box. After the move, keep an outdoor cat indoors for at least 2 weeks before you let it outside, so that it learns its new home." .

:su_01M82H6T2SJCWQ88GWH3NA9WX3 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Quiet hours are from 22:00 to 07:00 on weekdays and from 22:00 to 09:00 on weekends and public holidays. During quiet hours, residents must avoid noise that can be heard in other flats or in the inner yard, including music, drilling and persistent barking." .

:cn_01M82GNRCASH6DKSRYKE0WQE7V a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "4"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
            owl:minQualifiedCardinality "3"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
            owl:onClass :cn_01M82GM2G3AM0SX444VHV3202H ;
            owl:onProperty :rl_01M82GM2G3AM0SX444VHV3202T ],
        :cn_01M82GJP3CRKNX3DNJZDNANDWM ;
    skos:broader :cn_01M82GJP3CRKNX3DNJZDNANDWM ;
    skos:definition "A dog younger than 6 months." ;
    skos:prefLabel "puppy" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCQ,
        :su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCS,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDNY,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDNZ,
